cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EVA in research or software, please cite this repository and its release."
title: "EVA — Evidence Algorithm"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Alexandre"
    family-names: "do Vale Brostel"
version: 8.0.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21500611"
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  EVA is a provider-neutral architecture for verifiable documentary memory.
  It preserves document hierarchy, indexes literal primary evidence, and
  evaluates evidence interactions only within the isolated query that requires
  them. Optional connector modules can observe validated interactions without
  altering the documentary Core.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - document intelligence
  - evidence traceability
  - semantic retrieval
  - PHP
